---
import '@fontsource/playfair-display/600.css';
---

<div class="canvas-home">
  <nav class="canvas-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a class="brand" href="/#home" aria-label="Canvas home"><span class="brand-mark">C</span><span>canvas</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links"><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="#templates">Templates</a><a href="#why-canvas">Why Canvas</a></div>
    <div class="nav-actions"><a class="login-link" href="/contact">Log in</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#start">Start building <span>↗</span></a></div>
    <button class="menu-button" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Your next idea, online</p>
        <h1>Make a website<br /><em>worth visiting.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">Canvas gives your ideas a place to live. Start with a thought, a template, or a blank page and make it yours in minutes.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" id="start"><a class="primary-action" href="#builder">Create with AI <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-action" href="#templates">Browse templates <span>↓</span></a></div>
        <div class="hero-note"><span class="avatars"><i>J</i><i>M</i><i>A</i></span><span>Made by curious people, every day.</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="builder-preview" id="builder" aria-label="Canvas website builder preview">
        <div class="preview-window">
          <div class="window-bar"><span class="window-dots"><b></b><b></b><b></b></span><span class="window-address">canvas.site / your-space</span><span class="window-tools">◌ &nbsp; ⋯</span></div>
          <div class="preview-body">
            <aside class="builder-sidebar"><div class="sidebar-label">BUILD</div><button class="sidebar-item active"><span>✦</span> AI assistant</button><button class="sidebar-item"><span>▦</span> Elements</button><button class="sidebar-item"><span>◫</span> Pages</button><div class="sidebar-label second">STYLE</div><button class="sidebar-item"><span>◒</span> Colors</button><button class="sidebar-item"><span>Aa</span> Type</button><div class="sidebar-footer"><span class="online-dot"></span> Autosaved</div></aside>
            <div class="site-canvas"><div class="canvas-toolbar"><span>Home / Edit</span><span class="toolbar-pill">Desktop⌄</span><span>•••</span></div><div class="site-page"><div class="mock-site-nav"><strong>morrow</strong><span>Work &nbsp; About &nbsp; Journal</span><button>Let's talk ↗</button></div><div class="mock-site-hero"><span class="tiny-label">INDEPENDENT CREATIVE STUDIO</span><h2>Ideas with<br /><i>somewhere</i> to go.</h2><p>We shape thoughtful brands and digital experiences for a changing world.</p><button class="mock-link">See our work <span>↗</span></button></div><div class="mock-site-footer"><span>Scroll to explore</span><span class="footer-line"></span><span>01 — 04</span></div></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="float-card prompt-card"><span class="spark">✦</span><div><small>CANVAS AI</small><strong>Make it feel more editorial</strong></div><span class="send">↑</span></div>
        <div class="float-card color-card"><span class="color-swatch"></span><div><small>PALETTE</small><strong>Warm minimal</strong></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mode-section" id="why-canvas">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A starting point that fits</p><h2>Three ways in.<br /><em>One place to make it yours.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="mode-switch" role="tablist" aria-label="Ways to build"><button class="mode-tab active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-mode="ai">01 &nbsp; Ask AI</button><button class="mode-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-mode="template">02 &nbsp; Pick a template</button><button class="mode-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-mode="blank">03 &nbsp; Start from scratch</button></div>
      <div class="mode-content"><div class="mode-number">01</div><div><h3 data-mode-title>Tell it what you’re imagining.</h3><p data-mode-copy>Describe your idea in plain English and Canvas turns it into a considered first draft. Keep the magic, change everything else.</p></div><a href="#start" class="round-arrow" aria-label="Try this mode">↗</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="steps-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="steps-intro"><p class="eyebrow">From blank page to live link</p><h2>Good things<br /><em>take shape.</em></h2><p>No tutorials to binge. No design degree required. Just a clear idea and a little room to play.</p></div><div class="steps-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Bring the spark</h3><p>Start with a sentence, a mood, or a half-formed thought.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Make it yours</h3><p>Move, remix, and refine every detail with intuitive controls.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Put it out there</h3><p>Publish a beautiful, responsive site when it feels ready.</p></div></article></div></section>

    <section class="templates-section" id="templates"><div class="template-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little head start</p><h2>Start somewhere<br /><em>interesting.</em></h2></div><a class="text-action" href="/contact">See all templates <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="template-grid"><article class="template-card orange"><span>PORTFOLIO</span><h3>Good form</h3><small>A portfolio for work with a point of view.</small><b>↗</b></article><article class="template-card blue"><span>NEWSLETTER</span><h3>Sunday best</h3><small>A bright little home for your big thoughts.</small><b>↗</b></article><article class="template-card yellow"><span>SMALL BUSINESS</span><h3>Field notes</h3><small>Make your offering easy to find.</small><b>↗</b></article></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="canvas-footer"><a class="brand" href="/#home"><span class="brand-mark">C</span><span>canvas</span></a><span>Make something people remember.</span><span>© 2026 Canvas</span></footer>
</div>

<script>
  const initBuilder = () => {
    const tabs = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.mode-tab');
    const title = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-mode-title]');
    const copy = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-mode-copy]');
    const content = {
      ai: ['Tell it what you’re imagining.', 'Describe your idea in plain English and Canvas turns it into a considered first draft. Keep the magic, change everything else.'],
      template: ['Start with a point of view.', 'Choose a shape that feels close, then make it unmistakably yours with your words, images, and rhythm.'],
      blank: ['A blank page, with good company.', 'Drag in the building blocks you need and make something that could only have come from you.'],
    } as const;
    tabs.forEach((tab) => tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      tabs.forEach((item) => { item.classList.remove('active'); item.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false'); });
      tab.classList.add('active'); tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
      const next = content[tab.dataset.mode as keyof typeof content];
      if (title && copy && next) { title.textContent = next[0]; copy.textContent = next[1]; }
    }));
  };
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initBuilder);
  initBuilder();

  const menuButton = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.menu-button');
  const navLinks = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.nav-links');
  menuButton?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const isOpen = navLinks?.classList.toggle('mobile-open') ?? false;
    menuButton.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(isOpen));
  });
</script>

<style>
  :global(html) { background: #f3f0e9; }
  :global(body) { background: #f3f0e9; color: #171916; }
  .canvas-home { --ink: #171916; --paper: #f3f0e9; --line: rgba(23, 25, 22, .16); --coral: #ed684b; min-height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; background: var(--paper); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; }
  .canvas-nav { position: relative; width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px)); height: 86px; margin: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.06em; text-decoration: none; }.brand-mark { display: grid; width: 26px; height: 26px; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .nav-links, .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 30px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }.nav-links a, .login-link { color: #555751; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }.nav-links a:hover, .login-link:hover { color: var(--ink); }.nav-cta { padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 100px; background: var(--ink); color: white; text-decoration: none; }.nav-cta span { margin-left: 13px; color: #fa9c85; }.menu-button { display: none; border: 0; background: transparent; font-size: 20px; }
  .hero { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: auto; padding: 102px 0 148px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .78fr 1.22fr; gap: 72px; align-items: center; }.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #777a71; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }.eyebrow-dot { display: inline-block; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-right: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--coral); }h1, h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(50px, 6vw, 80px); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.065em; font-weight: 600; }h1 em, h2 em { color: var(--coral); font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.07em; }.hero-lede { max-width: 390px; margin: 30px 0; color: #666960; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }.hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; }.primary-action { padding: 15px 19px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--ink); color: white; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }.primary-action span { margin-left: 24px; color: #fa9c85; }.text-action { color: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }.text-action span { margin-left: 10px; color: var(--coral); }.hero-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 57px; color: #85877f; font-size: 10px; }.avatars { display: flex; }.avatars i { display: grid; width: 22px; height: 22px; margin-right: -5px; place-items: center; border: 2px solid var(--paper); border-radius: 50%; background: #adc2bc; color: white; font-size: 9px; font-style: normal; }.avatars i:nth-child(2) { background: #d28d70; }.avatars i:nth-child(3) { background: #6b758c; }
</style>

